text:
This work complements recent evidence from
@AISecurityInst’s long-horizon cyber-range evaluation of Claude Mythos Preview and
@AnthropicAI’s work on AI-assisted vulnerability discovery.  

AgentCyberRange focuses on the remaining infrastructure gap: open, multi-range, third-party reproducible evaluation across realistic web and internal-network environments.

